\title{rsymbolic2: Symbolic Regression via Genetic Programming}
\description{
Discovers mathematical expressions that fit data using a steady-state genetic programming algorithm with Levenberg-Marquardt constant optimization. The search engine is implemented in C++ and exposed through a single R function. The default configuration and search behaviour are matched to the documented defaults of 'PySR' and 'SymbolicRegression.jl', described in Cranmer (2023) \doi{10.48550/arXiv.2305.01582}; this package is an independent re-implementation and is not affiliated with or endorsed by those projects. See the NOTICE file for attribution.
}
